	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Postquam mihi delineasti argumentum epistolae <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>per <persName>Friderychum</persName> nostrum ad me scriptae diligentius <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>scrinia mea scrutatus invenio epistolam ipsis septembris <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>calendis ad me scriptam de legatione sua ad <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><placeName ref="l522">Venetos</placeName>; deinde alia quoque invenio scriptam 8. <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>septembris, ut iam existimem nullam inter<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>cidisse.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quoniam vero tu scribebas superiore <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>septimana eius ad me literas misisse, subdubitavi <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>de fide tabellionis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Pro epistola eius ad te scripta <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>magnas ago gratias eamque nunc remitto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Gratias <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ago et pro iis, quae communicasti accepta ex literis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/><placeName ref="l28">Basiliensibus</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ego vero nunc praeter ea, quae nuper <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>scribebam, nihil habeo, nisi quod ex agro <placeName ref="l41">Bernensi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>scribitur Bernenses 15000 virorum fac<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>turos delectum, non ut cuiquam militem cedant, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>sed ut pro defensione patriae res componant, ne <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quid neglexisse videantur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">- De colloquio nihil audimus <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>amplius, nisi quod de modo eius contendere <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>dicuntur colloqutores.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">- Ex <placeName ref="l832">Galliis</placeName> scribitur regem <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ingentem parare exercitum, quem opponat <lb xml:id="p1z21"/><persName>Philippo</persName> regi progressus alioqui facienti <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>non infelices.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> scribitur <persName>Boll<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>wylerum</persName> cum exercitu suo subversis duobus <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>in <placeName ref="l691">Lotharingia</placeName> oppidulis festinare in <placeName ref="l631">Burgundiam</placeName><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>, ut suas copias coniungat cum aliis in <placeName ref="l631">Bur<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>gundiam</placeName> quoque festinantibus, ut Divionem (Dysion <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>imm <placeName>Hoch-Burgund</placeName>) obsidione cingant et <persName ref="p8112">regis Gallorum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>vires distrahant.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ita fertur ab <placeName ref="l834">Italis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>hac transeuntibus omnes <placeName ref="l834">Italiae</placeName> copias, quas <placeName ref="l1098">Flor<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>entinus</placeName>, <placeName ref="l1122">Parmensis</placeName>, <placeName ref="l1671">Pisanus</placeName> et <placeName>Albanus</placeName> collegere, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>mittendas in <placeName ref="l736">Pedemontem</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Postridie abibit <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> legatus d. <persName>Ioannes Aescherus</persName>; Bernae iungent <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>se ei urbium evangelicarum legati, qui recta <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>ad regem proficiscentur supplicaturi rursus pro <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>salute fidelium.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Nam propter evangelium Christi multi <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>per <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> coniiciuntur in carceres, et <placeName ref="l378">Lutetiae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>dicuntur vincti ad 200.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Dominus bene fortunet le<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>gationem hanc et emolliat cor Pharaonis etc.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Cum per negotia modo privatim non possim <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>scribere d. <persName ref="p8432">Friderycho a Salicibus</persName>, tu obse<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>cro tuas hasce ipsi communica, ut meis sic parcatur <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>curis et una fidelia, quod dicitur, duos dealbem <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>parietes.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Filius eius <persName>Ioannes</persName> recte valet, nisi <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>quod pro huius aetatis ratione scabie vexatur.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Nuper <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>etiam ulcera plurima eruperunt in ventre; <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>sed cura et medicina uxoris meae subsiderunt <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>et iam propemodum sanata sunt.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Es ist ein allt <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>sprüchwort: Rüdig und unflätig in der jugendt, <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>suber und rein im allter.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Nolui ergo parentem esse <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>solicitum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de" ana="salute">"Vatter, es ist guͦt umb mich, und gruͦtz dich und die muͦter <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>fast trulich etc."</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Haec volui insereret manu sua filius, ut cerneret pater incolumia ess<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>e omnia.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, chare frater et compater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Commenda me d. d. consulibus et fratribus atque symmystis<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salveat d. <persName ref="p8432">Friderychus</persName> cum socero et tota domo etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 8. octobris 1557.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Pr<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>aestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae ministro <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>fideli, compatri suo colendo et dilecto.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de">Dem herren pfarrer zuͦ Sant <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>Martin ze <placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
